    <literalExpression id="decision_the_over_limit_investor_case_qualifies_literal">
      <text>`the transaction qualifies for the section 4(a)(6) exemption` OF `a clean issuer`, (`an offering of` OF 0, 500000, FALSE), (`an investor with` OF FALSE, 60000, 200000, 9000), 5000, (`an arrangement with` OF 21, 1), `a conforming filing`</text>
